nction np_cast in module rlm.mcp_base:\n\nasync np_cast(**kwargs: 'Any') -> 'Any'\n    Opens your spellbook to cast a spell.\n    \n    Arguments (JSON Schema):\n    {}\n\n\n=== np_rest ===\nHelp on function np_rest in module rlm.mcp_base:\n\nasync np_rest(**kwargs: 'Any') -> 'Any'\n    Rests n-moves while doing nothing or until something happens (default=5).\n    \n    Arguments (JSON Schema):\n    {}\n\n\n=== np_pray ===\nHelp on function np_pray in module rlm.mcp_base:\n\nasync np_pray(**kwargs: 'Any') -> 'Any'\n    Pray to the gods for help.\n    \n    Arguments (JSON Schema):\n    {}\n\n\n=== np_kick ===\nHelp on function np_kick in module rlm.mcp_base:\n\nasync np_kick(**kwargs: 'Any') -> 'Any'\n    Kick something.\n    \n    Arguments (JSON Schema):\n    {}\n\n\n=== np_go_to ===\nHelp on function np_go_to in module rlm.mcp_base:\n\nasync np_go_to(**kwargs: 'Any') -> 'Any'\n    Moves to the specified room or corridor using the shortest path possible.\n    \n    Arguments (JSON Schema):\n    {}\n\n\n",
