        "content": "[reveal (x20-45, y8-20):\ny 8: ---.----------#           \ny 9:  ###          #           \ny10: ##            #           \ny11:               #           \ny12: -----       ####          \ny13: ....| ##@####             \ny14: .....##     #             \ny15: ....|        .            \ny16: -----                     \ny17:               ------      \ny18:                           \ny19:                           \ny20:                           ]\n\n=== SURROUNDINGS (hidden; call reveal(x1,y1,x2,y2) for the map plus ADJACENT / VISIBLE FEATURES / VISIBLE MONSTERS / MESSAGES) ===\n\n=== STATUS ===\nHP: 9/16  AC: 2  Dlvl: 5  Turn: 651  XP: 1  $: 11  Pos: (28,13)\nCharacter: valkyrie (human, neutral)\n\n=== INVENTORY ===\n  $: 11 gold pieces\n  b: a blessed +1 long sword (weapon in hand)\n  c: a +0 dagger (alternate weapon; not wielded)\n  d: an uncursed +3 small shield (being worn)\n  e: an uncursed food ration\n  f: a +0 scale mail (being worn)\n\n=== ADJACENT === N=  NE=  E=# SE=  S=  SW=  W=# NW= \n\n=== VISIBLE FEATURES === stairs DOWN at (19,13); stairs UP at (21,6); door (open/gap) at (11,4), (20,5), (33,5), (23,8), (19,12), (24,14), (17,15); food/corpse at (24,5); armor at (6,5); weapon at (5,3), (6,3), (7,3), (8,3), (9,3), (5,4), (6,4), (7,4), (8,4), (9,4), (5,5), (7,5), (8,5)\n\n=== MESSAGES ===\n  You kill the gecko!\n\n",
